ktop users create notes within a category via the right-click menu on a category, which calls `notes.openRightClickMenu(event, 'category', category.id)` which sets `this.createParent = category.id`. So the desktop flow for creating a note in a specific category goes through right-click, not the Add button.\\n\\nThe mobile category detail view has the \\\"Add Note\\\" button in the category header (line 118). This is the button in question. It needs to set `notes.createParent` to the current category before opening the modal.\\n\\n**Fix approach:** In `NoteNavigationMobile.svelte`, the \\\"Add Note\\\" button in the category detail view (line 118) should set the create parent to `current.id`. Since `createParent` is on the shared `NotesSvelte` store, we can set `notes.createParent = current.id` before calling `openModal('note')`. \\n\\nLet me consider how the `create()` function resets `createParent`. It resets it after creating. But there's a subtlety: `openModal('note')` doesn't reset `createParent` either, so if the user previously opened a right-click menu... Act... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n45: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1788619751598,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0720b80a80013LkRDCBTzfhL10\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0720b6ff0001hAtYIAsYR4F0zI\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":28910,\"input\":2399,\"output\":655,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":25856}},\"cost\":0.001243228}}\n46: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1788619752437,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0720b83f3001u0h7pEJHmwKVHM\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0720b80ad001Jm5sBoFEhX4AaU\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n47: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1788619752684,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"part\":{\"t