 is set.\\n\\nLooking at the code:\\n\\n**Mobile (`NoteNavigationMobile.svelte`):** The mobile nav maintains its own `stack` state locally, with `current` being the currently viewed category. When the user taps \\\"Add Note\\\" (`AddNoteButton`), it calls `notes.openModal('note')` — but it does NOT set `notes.createParent`. So when the modal confirms and `notes.create()` runs, `this.createParent` is `null`, so the note is created without a category (in the root).\\n\\n**Desktop (`NoteNavigationDesktop.svelte`):** Let me verify the desktop path sets `createParent` appropriately, and understand how `openModal('note')` should set `createParent`.\\n\\nLet me read the desktop navigation and the category renderer.\\n\\n\",\"time\":{\"start\":1788619746268,\"end\":1788619747302}}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1788619747313,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0720b6fec0018CNFz899p15W7v\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0720b68df001adZwPR8RuvFUnQ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":26362,\"input\":2769,\"output\":297,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":23296}},\"cost\":0.001123108}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1788619748711,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0720b75650011nxx4QaXqWSpDx\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0720b6ff0001hAtYIAsYR4F0zI\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1788619751507,\"sessionID\":\"ses_f8df4cef5ffeQvGnhv2x0LLXr4\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"chatcmpl-tool-9e320a9c3ca6bc68\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"tests/**/*.ts\"},\"output\":\"/workspace/tests/unit/stores/WelcomeTour.test.ts\\n/workspace/tests/unit/stores/UserNotifications.test.ts\\n/workspace/tests/unit/stores/UserManagement.test.ts\\n/workspace/t