{"type":"text","timestamp":1788619991547,"sessionID":"ses_f8df34085ffedgwCvVGAM3ECYG","part":{"id":"prt_0720f24db001E5e6TdFQf2Hiox","messageID":"msg_0720f11f200116c9fo4bV4nsgy","sessionID":"ses_f8df34085ffedgwCvVGAM3ECYG","type":"text","text":"Found it — the `TodoFilterService` failure is a **pre-existing, date-dependent test bug**: the test computes `endOfWeek` via `setDate(startOfWeek.getDate() + 6)` where `startOfWeek.getDate()` is 30 (Aug 30), so `setDate(36)` on Sep 5 overflows to Oct 6. It only fails when the week spans a month boundary — today is exactly such a day. Unrelated to my change. Let me verify the `logic-leaves` failure is also environmental.","time":{"start":1788619990235,"end":1788619991546}}}
