{"type":"text","timestamp":1788620117352,"sessionID":"ses_f8df34085ffedgwCvVGAM3ECYG","part":{"id":"prt_072110ea7001iEpFz1SATbx2Y2","messageID":"msg_07210cc590011qyhzuL73P77BC","sessionID":"ses_f8df34085ffedgwCvVGAM3ECYG","type":"text","text":"Both failures are confirmed pre-existing and unrelated to my changes:\n\n1. **TodoFilterService week test** — the test itself has a month-boundary bug: `endOfWeek.setDate(startOfWeek.getDate() + 6)` where `startOfWeek.getDate()` = 30 (Aug 30), producing `setDate(36)` → Oct 6, when the actual week is Aug 30–Sep 5. Only fails when the week crosses a month boundary — exactly today's case.\n2. **logic-leaves StatisticWidget** — Tailwind class `.bg-blue-50` not found in test env; unrelated to notes.\n\nNeither touches any code I modified. Now let me commit the session.log and write `implementation.md`.","time":{"start":1788620115623,"end":1788620117350}}}
